type: image
style: photography with chalk overlay
aspect: 16:9
resolution: 2048x1152

prompt: |
  A real green chalkboard photographed straight-on, filling the entire frame.
  The board shows a brilliant lecture in progress — a mix of:
  - White chalk diagrams: a neural network with labeled nodes and arrows
  - Yellow chalk: key equations highlighted and underlined (E = mc^2, f(x) = ...)
  - Blue chalk: a flowchart showing "input -> process -> learn -> repeat"
  - Pink chalk: circled "IMPORTANT!" note with arrow pointing to key concept
  Hand-drawn robot doodle in the bottom-right corner (simple, cute, holding chalk)
  Wooden chalk tray at the bottom with 4 pieces of colored chalk and an eraser
  Real chalk texture: slightly dusty, uneven strokes, eraser smudges visible
  The handwriting should look like an actual professor's — confident but imperfect
  Some areas partially erased (ghostly remnants of previous content)
  Warm classroom lighting. Green board color: #2d4a2d to #365636

usage: Hero banner for the Chalkboard theme — the board IS the interface.
